  "description": "Joined-target updates (P1 has two children, P3 one, P2 none), all with dbFailOnError: P INNER JOIN C SET P.Name = constant; SET P.Name = C.Tag; UPDATE DISTINCTROW of the same join; UPDATE of the saved SELECT DISTINCT query QDistinctP; a two-target SET P.Name, C.Tag; P LEFT JOIN C SET C.Tag (child absent for P2); and P2/C2 updates of the join field C2.PID with dbConsistent and with dbInconsistent added. Asks the return, RecordsAffected, Errors and the parent and child rows after each.",
